              "text": "subveniō, subvenīre — \"to come to help\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Vīcīnī celeriter subvēnērunt. The neighbours quickly came to help."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "subveniō, subvenīre, subvēnī, subventum, with the dative: mihi subvēnit. English subvention."
            }
          ]
        },
